      "message": "Missing definition of this function in some header file?\n\nAlso, I wonder if we we really need a board-specific function, or if we can just use 2 different config options? AFAICT there are only 2 options here: either we do recovery by volume_up+volume_down, or we do it by a single GPIO.",
